  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Dark Circles</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Medium Coverage</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A pro-performance, multiuse concealer that visibly lifts, blurs, and brightens your under-eyes and complexion for an awakened appearance.<br><br><b>Coverage: </b>Medium<br><b><br>Finish: </b>Natural<br><b><br>Formulation: </b>Liquid<br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Caffeine: Visibly reduces puffiness and dark circles.​<br>- Fermented Marine Microorganisms: Smooth skin with collagen-like stimulation and a visibly tightening effect.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, triclosan, and contains less than one percent synthetic fragrance. It is also vegan</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(59, 59, 59); font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\" >Four Ways to Surrealskin™:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(59, 59, 59); font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">-One: To conceal, brighten, and blur under eyes: Select one shade lighter than your skin tone.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(59, 59, 59); font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">For an extra bright, lifted look: Extend and blend concealer past outer eye corners.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(59, 59, 59); font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">-Two: To cover spots, blemishes, redness, and hyperpigmentation: Select a shade that matches your skin tone. After applying, wait a few moments before blending. Build to achieve desired coverage.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(59, 59, 59); font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">-Three: To highlight your complexion: Using your under-eye shade or one shade lighter, apply to center of forehead, bridge of nose, and middle of chin.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(59, 59, 59); font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">-Four: To blur fine lines: Using a shade that matches your skin tone, apply to deep creases and laugh lines.</span></p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p>-Caffeine: Reduces the look of puffiness and dark circles.</p><p>-Fermented Marine Micro-Organisms: Smooth skin with a collagen like stimulation and a tightening effect.</p><p><br></p><div style=\" border-box; outline: 0px; --context-coalesce-label-color: #000; --context-coalesce-label-font-weight: 600; width: 928.453px; position: relative; padding: 0px; color: rgb(59, 59, 59); font-family: Montserrat, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" ><div style=\" border-box; outline: 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224); box-shadow: rgb(0, 0, 0) 0px 1px 5px -6px; clear: both;\"><div style=\" border-box; outline: 0px; position: relative;\"><div style=\" border-box; outline: 0px; color: rgb(26, 32, 40); min-height: 44px; max-height: 200px; overflow: auto; tab-size: 5; white-space: pre-wrap; border-top: none !important; border-right: none !important; border-bottom: 0px none rgb(26, 32, 40) !important; border-left: none !important; border-image: initial !important; font-size: 12px !important;\"><p style=\" border-box; outline: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px;\">Aqua, Phenylisopropyl Dimethicone, Isododecane, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Butylene Glycol, Dimethicone, Cetyl PEG/PPG-10/1 Dimethicone, PEG-10 Dimethicone, Coconut Alkanes, Methyl Methacrylate Crosspolymer, Sodium Chloride, Squalane, Phenoxyethanol, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Aluminum Dimyristate, Caffeine, Disodium Stearoyl Glutamate, Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Coco-Caprylate/Caprate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Saccharide Isomerate, Tocopherol, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-Di-T-Butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Sodium Ferrocyanide [May Contain +/-: Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Bismuth Oxychloride (CI 77163)].</p></div></div></div></div></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Dark Circles</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Medium Coverage</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A pro-performance, multiuse concealer that visibly lifts, blurs, and brightens your under-eyes and complexion for an awakened appearance.<br><br><b>Coverage: </b>Medium<br><b><br>Finish: </b>Natural<br><b><br>Formulation: </b>Liquid<br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Caffeine: Visibly reduces puffiness and dark circles.​<br>- Fermented Marine Microorganisms: Smooth skin with collagen-like stimulation and a visibly tightening effect.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, triclosan, and contains less than one percent synthetic fragrance. It is also vegan</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"fon